    },
    "%lld of %lld keys" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$lld of %2$#@keys@"
          },
          "substitutions" : {
            "keys" : {
              "argNum" : 2,
              "formatSpecifier" : "lld",
              "variations" : {
                "plural" : {
                  "one" : {
                    "stringUnit" : {
                      "state" : "translated",
                      "value" : "%arg key"
                    }
                  },
                  "other" : {
                    "stringUnit" : {
                      "state" : "translated",
                      "value" : "%arg keys"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$lld av %2$#@keys@"
          },
          "substitutions" : {
            "keys" : {
              "argNum" : 2,
              "formatSpecifier" : "lld",
              "variations" : {
                "plural" : {
                  "one" : {
                    "stringUnit" : {
                      "state" : "translated",
                      "value" : "%arg tangent"
                    }
                  },
                  "other" : {
                    "stringUnit" : {
                      "state" : "translated",
                      "value" : "%arg tangenter"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A wedge between strings 2 and 3 of the key leaves string 1; hold the key down while it goes in, so the damper is not bent. Tune it as an octave from below, then the other strings pure against it. High up: short, firm strikes, listen right after the attack, and check against two or three octaves down. If a unison at the top is hard to hear, pluck the strings one after the other." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En kil mellan sträng 2 och 3 i tangenten lämnar sträng 1; håll tangenten nere när den sätts i, så att dämparen inte böjs. Stäm den som oktav nedifrån, sedan de andra strängarna rena mot den. Högt upp: korta, kraftiga anslag, lyssna direkt efter anslaget och kontrollera mot två–tre oktaver ner. Är ett kor längst upp svårt att höra: knäpp på strängarna en i taget."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A4 and A3" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A4 och A3"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A4 to the target, then A3 as an octave below it. The tenth F3–A4 should beat as fast as the third F3–A3 (a 4:2 octave) or slightly faster; if the third is faster, A3 is too high. F3 is not tuned yet, but the comparison holds." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A4 till målet, sedan A3 som oktav under. Decimen F3–A4 ska sväva lika fort som tersen F3–A3 (oktav 4:2) eller något snabbare; svävar tersen snabbast ligger A3 för högt. F3 är inte stämd än, men jämförelsen håller ändå."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All A, 8 keys" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alla A, 8 tangenter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All keys" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alla tangenter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "B for %@ differs from the neighbouring keys and is not used; measure it again with Measure inharmonicity (B) under Partials vs target." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "B för %@ avviker från grannarna och används inte; mät om med Mät inharmonicitet (B) under Deltoner mot mål."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back to %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tillbaka till %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bass %@–%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
